### Login correto (deve dar 200 com o token)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "giovane@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "senha12345"
}

### Senha errada (deve dar 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "giovane@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "errada123"
}

### E-mail que não existe (deve dar 401, com a MESMA mensagem)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/usuarios/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "naoexiste@exemplo.com",
  "senha": "senha12345"
}

@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Perfil com token (deve dar 200)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sem token (deve dar 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/usuarios/me

### Token inválido (deve dar 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/usuarios/me
Authorization: Bearer abc